  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "The table lists 69 non-functional requirements (ANC.NFXNREQ.001–069) for a digital antenatal care system, each with its category, covering security (confidentiality, authentication, audit trail and logs, user management) and system requirements (general, scalability, usability, configuration, interoperability, hardware and connectivity).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
